      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHY NOT AVA (1) was below best at her last start when 8th at Healesville following a second place finish (17.08) there two back. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from 10 starts. Ready to return to form. ABRACADABRA (5) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (20.50) at this track over 350m. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Can feature again. ZIPPING NUTTALL (4) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 2.25 lengths away in second (17.08). Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expecting another good run. PETITE BEAST (2) did a good job to finish third last time out over 350m at this track (20.36) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
